      <mxCell id="hdr_banner" value="T211 • 8-CARD FINOPS MICRO-CHARTS • EXECUTIVE ROI &amp; BOARD RISK LENS • REGULATED ENTERPRISE
Executive AI FinOps &amp; ROI 8-Card Micro-Chart Playbook
How Engineering &amp; Finance Teams Deliver Verifiable AI Returns Without Blowing Token or License Budgets
Stack Anchor: Google Cloud Vertex AI + Spanner Graph + Model Armor + OpenTelemetry  |  KPIs: Payback &lt;= 4.2 Months · -68% Cost / Outcome · 100% Audit Lineage" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="24" width="864" height="116" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="SubBanner" value="GOVERNANCE &amp; PERSONA CONTRACT: Board Sign-Off Gate: Fund next phase strictly from verified pilot savings.
HIPAA / SOX / GxP Deterministic Audit Trail • VPC-SC + Customer-Managed Encryption (CMEK)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="150" width="864" height="42" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_1" value="Concept • Cost Iceberg
01 • What AI Really Costs
📊 License/API is 15% tip; 85% is Data Prep + Integration + Training + Eval Upkeep
✓ Budget for Day-2 evals &amp; maintenance, never just Day-1 launch" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="208" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_2" value="Key Formulas • Unit Economics
02 • The Verified ROI Math
📊 Monthly Value = Hours Saved × Loaded Rate × Verified Active Adoption %
✓ Payback (Months) = Setup Cost ÷ Monthly Net Validated Gain" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="472" y="208" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_3" value="Strategy • $ to $$$$ Escalation
03 • Buy Before You Build Ladder
📊 1. Use included features ($) -&gt; 2. Off-the-shelf ($$) -&gt; 3. Low-code ($$$) -&gt; 4. Custom ($$$$)
✓ Climb one rung only when the rung below fails measured SLOs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="424" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_4" value="Cost Lever • Tiered Routing
04 • Right-Size the Model Cascade
📊 Overkill (Frontier for bool gates) vs Right-Sized (Flash -&gt; Argon cascade) vs Too Weak (Rework!)
✓ Route 80% of deterministic/triage turns to &lt;15ms small models" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="472" y="424" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_5" value="Process • Capital Discipline
05 • 30-Day Self-Funding Pilot Loop
📊 Pick 1 high-volume use case -&gt; Run 30-day pilot -&gt; Measure net savings -&gt; Scale or Kill
✓ Fund every subsequent wave strictly from the prior pilot&#x27;s savings" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="640" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_6" value="Control • FinOps Alerts
06 • Break-Even &amp; Spend Telemetry
📊 Track Cost Curve vs Realized Value Curve until Break-Even crossover (Month 3.8)
✓ Measure cost-per-successful-task (CPSO), never raw token volume" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="472" y="640" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_7" value="Licenses • 24-Seat Audit Grid
07 • Cut Zombie Licenses Monthly
📊 15 Active Power Seats (Green) vs 9 Dormant Seats (Gray) = 37.5% Immediate Waste
✓ Reclaim &amp; reassign inactive seats every 30 days before buying more" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="28" y="856" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="fin_card_8" value="People • Adoption Lever
08 • Role-Based Enablement Multiplier
📊 Tool Only (1.2x Value/Cost) vs Tool + 45m Role-Based Workflows (3.8x Value/Cost)
✓ Appoint 1 practitioner AI Champion per squad to compound adoption" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="472" y="856" width="420" height="198" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
